      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your struggle highlights the deep philosophical tension between the necessity of survival and the search for inherent meaning. Many thinkers find temporary grounding in stoic practices or creative engagement to make this burden feel less heavy. Consider exploring these perspectives to help rebuild a sense of utility in your existence.",
